#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_CouldntFindMonForMe"
msgid ""
"So, like, I couldn't find myself any\n"
"POKéMON that were, like, for me.\p"
"So, I figured, like, hey, I should file\n"
"a complaint to the guy there?\p"
"And he wouldn't hear me out, like, hey!\n"
"So, like, total bummer, man!\p"
"Hey, like, you! Zip it, you know?\n"
"Just, you know, take this!$"
msgstr ""
"就是说，我找不到适合我的\n"
"宝可梦，你懂吧。\p"
"所以，我就想，嘿，\n"
"我该去找那边那个人投诉一下吧？\p"
"结果他根本不听我说，真是的！\n"
"简直太扫兴了，老兄！\p"
"喂，就是你！闭嘴，懂吗？\n"
"总之，你懂的，拿着这个！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:285
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_ExplainTorment"
msgid ""
"That's, like, TM41, you know?\n"
"Hey, it's TORMENT, you hearing me?\p"
"Like, it won't let the other guy\n"
"use the same move twice in a row, see?\p"
"Hey, now, you listen here, like,\n"
"I'm not laying a torment on you!$"
msgstr ""
"那个嘛，就是招式学习器41，\n"
"懂吗？嘿，是无理取闹，听到没？\p"
"就是说，它能让对手没法连续两\n"
"次使用同一个招式，懂了吧？\p"
"喂，你给我听好了，\n"
"我可没有在对你无理取闹哦！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:293
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_IllTryUsingBugMons"
msgid ""
"I don't really like BUG POKéMON,\n"
"but maybe I'll try using some for\l"
"a change of pace.\p"
"Who knows, I might even get to like\n"
"them!$"
msgstr ""
"我不太喜欢虫宝可梦，\n"
"不过也许可以换换口味，试着用一用。\p"
"说不定我还会喜欢上它们呢！$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:300
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_BattleEvenWithoutToughMons"
msgid ""
"You can battle all you want here even\n"
"if you don't have any tough POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"在这里，就算没有强大的宝可梦，\n"
"也能尽情地对战。$"

#: data/maps/SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby/scripts.inc:304
msgctxt "SlateportCity_BattleTentLobby_Text_NiceIfMoreSelection"
msgid ""
"Wouldn't it be nice if they had more of\n"
"a selection?$"
msgstr "要是能有更多选择就好了，你说是不是？$"
